<p>On its last pulse, your Tremor Engine shakes violently, raising a volcano for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 3, 4, 5, 6</acronym> turns.</p><p>Each turn, the volcano will send out fiery boulders that deal <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>steampower 100">60, 81, 98, 111, 124</acronym> fire and <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>steampower 100">60, 81, 98, 111, 124</acronym> physical damage.</p><p>Damage scales with your Steampower.</p><p><span style="font-style: italic"><span class="tstr-font-italic">All the fury of fire at your disposal!</span></span></p>